This is a web port of JPortal for Android
(https://github.com/codelif/jportal-android), Copyright (C) 2026 Harsh Sharma
(codelif), GPL-3.0-only. Its screens, copy, colours, icons and attendance maths
are carried over here. The portal client (request crypto, endpoints, marks PDF
parser) is ported from ktjiit (https://github.com/codelif/ktjiit) by the same
author.

Based on JPortal (https://github.com/codeblech/jportal) by Yash Malik
(codeblech), whose design and spirit both apps carry forward.

Portions of the protocol knowledge (endpoint names, payload shapes, the
LocalName and AES scheme) are derived from:

